** ------------------------------------------------------------------------
** Large-strain sweep with the 20-node reduced-integration hex (C3D20RUL),
** nu=0.30 -- the compressible case, re-run with quadratic elements as a
** baseline for comparison against the near-incompressible nu=0.47 case
** below (where the linear C3D8UL element showed severe volumetric
** locking; C3D20RUL is the locking-resistant element for this study).
**
** Right grip ramped 0 -> 285 mm (300% nominal strain on the 95 mm free
** length) over many adaptive increments, tracing gauge-section behaviour
** continuously through the finite-strain regime.
** ------------------------------------------------------------------------

*include, input=../../../meshes/dogbone_mesh_3d_quad.inp

*material, name=COMPRESSIBLENEOHOOKE, id=steellike
** K [MPa], G [MPa]  (E=210000, nu=0.47)
1166666.7, 71428.6

*section, name=section1, material=steellike, type=solid
all

*job, name=dogboneQuadSweepNu047, domain=3d
*solver, solver=NIST, name=theSolver
linsolver=pardiso

*fieldOutput
>>perNode, nSet=gripClampLeft, field=displacement, result=U, name=U_gripLeft
>>perNode, nSet=gripClampRight, field=displacement, result=U, name=U_gripRight
>>perNode, nSet=gaugeLeftEdge, field=displacement, result=U, name=U_gaugeLeft
>>perNode, nSet=gaugeRightEdge, field=displacement, result=U, name=U_gaugeRight

*output, type=monitor
fieldOutput=U_gripLeft, f(x)='mean(x[:,0])'
*output, type=monitor
fieldOutput=U_gripRight, f(x)='mean(x[:,0])'
*output, type=monitor
fieldOutput=U_gaugeLeft, f(x)='mean(x[:,0])'
*output, type=monitor
fieldOutput=U_gaugeRight, f(x)='mean(x[:,0])'

*step, solver=theSolver
maxInc=0.01, minInc=1e-7, maxNumInc=2000, maxIter=40, criticalIter=8, stepLength=1.0
>>dirichlet, name=gripLeft,  nSet=gripClampLeft,  field=displacement, 1=0.0,   2=0.0
>>dirichlet, name=gripRight, nSet=gripClampRight, field=displacement, 1=285.0, 2=0.0
>>dirichlet, name=z0,        nSet=z0Layer,        field=displacement, 3=0.0
